---
layout: base.njk
title: Events
---
<section class="wrap inside"><p class="eyebrow dark"><span></span>Around the club</p><h1>Club Events</h1><p class="lede">Gatherings and dates from the club calendar.</p>
{% if club.calendarId %}{% set calendar = "https://calendar.google.com/calendar/embed?src=" + (club.calendarId | query) + "&ctz=" + (club.calendarZone | query) %}
<iframe class="embed" title="Club Google Calendar" src="{{ calendar }}&amp;mode=AGENDA"></iframe><a class="textlink" href="{{ calendar }}">Open in Google Calendar ↗</a>
{% else %}<div class="notice"><h2>Club calendar</h2><p>The public calendar will appear here when the club connects it.</p></div>{% endif %}</section>
